                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty bland game with a cool concept. I liked the idea of playing capture the flag in a RTS enviroment but the limited unit selection, below standard mechanics, and over all dated feel kept this game from hitting it's mark by a long shot.\n\nI'd say try it if you don't have any other games at all and you like RTS but I even think F2P options are higher quality.\nIt's not that horrible, but I would not even play it if it was free it's so sub-par.",
